//! tr kodlu 2 dil=en
// Error 20 — Module not found.
// Message code: H2112
// What happens: Importing a file that does not exist with import raises an error at run time.
// Why: The module path is resolved against the folder of the importing file; the file is not there.
// Fixed version:
//     import "helpers/geometry" // the module file really exists at this path
// Run (from the project root): tr examples/en/errors/20_module_not_found.tr   (exit code 1)

A070 "missing_module"
